e Director of Engineering's technical evaluation of user-friendly CMS platforms, it is beneficial to gauge the user's specific experience level with existing tools. This information will help narrow the options to a solution that perfectly matches the user's comfort level.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"To help us select the most user-friendly technology for your website, could you please choose the option that best describes your experience with managing website content?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"options\\\": [\\n    [\\n      \\\"I have never used a website builder or content management system (like WordPress, Squarespace, Wix, etc.) before.\\\",\\n      \\\"I have some experience using a website builder or content management system for personal or professional use.\\\",\\n      \\\"I am very comfortable using website builders and have managed website content extensively in the past.\\\"\\n    ]\\n  ]\\n}\\n###clarify-experience-20240520T121000Z###\\n###feedback-blank-response-logic-01###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: Feedback\\n{\\n  \\\"feedback_text\\\": \\\"I received a BLANK_RESPONSE_WARNING after submitting an empty response. My reasoning was that I was awaiting reports for two outstanding ORDER calls (plan-product-spec-01 and plan-tech-eval-01), which Rule #1 of my guide states is an acceptable scenario for a blank response. The warning message stated I had 'no unresolved system calls', which seems to contradict the nature of the ORDER/REPORT cycle. This behavior is confusing. The system should either not send a warning when there are outstanding orders, or the documentation should be updated to clarify the exact conditions under which a blank response is permissible.\\\"\\n}\\n###feedback-blank-response-logic-01###\"}]},\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"usage\":{\"inputCharacters\":26821,\"inputImages\":0,\"inputVideos\":0,\"inputAudioFiles\":0,\"outputCharacters\":3028,\"outputImages\":0,\"outputVideos\":0,\"outputAudioFiles\":0,\"inputTokens\":6516,\"outputTokens\":